0..76 Comment "// A recursive path whose endpoint calls a definition under a constructor of"
77..155 Comment "// a presented type (#424): the kernel reads the endpoint by the type\'s rules,"
156..233 Comment "// which may rewrite the constructor away to the call beneath it, and reads a"
234..308 Comment "// transport the recursive path leaves standing as a neutral on that path."
309..380 Comment "// The integers and their sum follow cubical Agda\'s `Cubical/Data/Int`."
382..443 Comment "// The integers, one successor more and one predecessor more."
